sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Reviewer
    participant A as Go API
    participant D as Firestore
    participant T as Other browsers
    U->>A: Confirm reset · POST /workbench/reset with no body
    A->>A: Check the separate reset request quota
    A->>D: Read board and last successful reset in a transaction
    alt Reset is available
        A->>D: Clear six accounts’ changes and advance revisions
        D-->>T: Restored board · two slots available
        A-->>U: 204 · reset committed
    else Previous reset was less than 60 seconds ago
        A-->>U: 429 · Retry-After in seconds
    end
    Note over A,D: Older drafts fail the revision check. Local portfolios in IndexedDB keep their work.
